+4.  **Texture Lookup:** Use the interpolated scalar value $s_f$ to look up the texture map [S1].
     *   If the fragment is on an isosurface, the texture returns the assigned material color [S1].
     *   If not, the texture returns an alpha value of 0 [S1].
